            "review_title": "Review at Icon - Sky Lounge",
            "review_text": "Lewis A\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible experience on firework nighg\nJun 2026 • Friends\nWe went on firework night. Staff were undertrained and had zero clues as to what was going on. We got sat in the rain and then our food took an hour and a half and they didn’t bring two of the mains for another 20 minutes so two of us finished eating before the other mains came out and at that point we cancelled the other mains and the only gave us a 10% discount. Do not go there on a busy night as it is very very incapable of accommodating to people. The staff were also rude and the manager didn’t appreciate the fact that our dining experience was terrible.\nRead more\nWritten June 14, 2026",
