            "review_text": "Garyward64\nHuddersfield, United Kingdom50 contributions\n0\nUnderwhelming and disappointing all round.\nMar 2025 • Couples\nGreat spot, lovely setting, however the food and service were simply dreadful. \nStarted off gave us one menu between 4. We asked for another which arrived and then was taken back. First dish was Fuji beef which was very good, after that it went downhill fast. The tuna was so over cooked it was inedible, we sent one lot back. The Thai green curry was awful, we have all had Thai green curry all over and this was by far the worst, again inedible we sent all back. I waited 30 minutes for a beer and had to ask for it 3 times. I have never been anywhere where the drink menu is so poor, beef or wine is it! No cocktails, no spirits, at all. Teatotal day for my wife who doesn’t drink beer or wine, her request for a G&T was met with a No we don’t do response,\nOverall a poor experience and one that promise do much. A wasted opportunity given the location. No excuse in an area surrounded by excellent restaurants.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2025",
